        "content": "<div style=\"padding:8px 14px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#c7d0d9;border-left:3px solid #B77D34;background:rgba(183,125,52,0.07)\"><b style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Source: tray host NIC counters</b> (<code>node_network_*</code> from node-exporter on 1,898 GB300 trays, pushed direct to the ObsVM). Each tray bonds two 400G ports (<code>enP22s2f0np0</code> + <code>enP22s2f1np1</code>) into <code>bond0</code> = 800G. Scope of this board set is the host NIC only; switch-side counters are outside it.<br><b style=\"color:#e6edf3\">Ethernet boards:</b> <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-fabric-overview\">Link state &amp; throughput</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-flaps-topology\">Link flaps</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-ber-errors\">L2 link errors</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a style=\"color:#8ab4f8\" href=\"/d/nvis-eth-buffers-drops\">Packet drops</a></div>",
        "mode": "html"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
